    "answer": {
      "short": "The map would be $80\\text{ m}\\times80\\text{ m}$, which is impractically large.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Actual side length}&=8\\text{ km}=8000\\text{ m}\\\\\\text{Map side length}&=8000\\text{ m}\\div100\\\\&=80\\text{ m}\\end{align*}$$\nBoth sides have the same length, so the map would be $80\\text{ m}\\times80\\text{ m}$. This is too large for a practical map.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
